<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_cbed980053d149349ef9ddc5219c97148442615cb0a07dfe6cb4571bf22fad4e_n0020/tu_0009> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Class III\nAmiodarone\nI_{hNa}\n,\nI_{Ca}\n,\nI_{Kr}\n,\nI_{Ki}\n,\nI_{Ks}\n,\nI_{to}\n,\n\\alpha\n,\n\\beta\n200–400 mg\nLoading dose:\n600–1200 mg/24 h 8–10 days\n4–14 weeks\nHepatic\nVT, VF, PVCs\nIncreases DFT, hypotension, bradycardia, AV block, QT prolongation, TdP (rare), hypothyroidism/hyperthyroidism, nausea, photosensitivity, skin discolouration, peripheral neuropathy, tremor, hepatitis, pulmonary fibrosis/pneumonitis\nHeart rate, blood pressure, ECG (QT interval), hepatic function\nSevere bradycardia and/or high-degree AV block in the absence of a pacemaker, decompensated HF, cardiogenic shock" .
